  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "key": "skill.1425.description",
    "text": "消耗<style=\"accent-gn\">40</style>點<style=\"accent-gn\">勇氣</style>，躍至空中向敵人奮力投擲出風之長矛。對範圍內的所有敵人造成<style=\"physical\">物理傷害</style>並大量削弱韌性值，並獲得1層<style=\"accent-gn\">銳利</style>。<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：面對有韌性條的敵方單位時裝配，也可在面對大量敵方單位時裝配。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-1505341141",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  },
  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "key": "skill.1427.description",
    "text": "向後騰挪並擲出長槍對目標範圍造成<style=\"anemo\">風元素傷害</style>，如果「戰意」 大於3點，強化為<style=\"accent-gn\">風神·飛鳥投</style>。<br><style=\"accent-gn\">風神·飛鳥投</style><br>消耗所有「戰意」後躍並奮力擲出長槍對目標範圍造成<style=\"anemo\">風元素傷害</style>，且為自身添加「護盾」，消耗「戰意」越多，護盾量提升越高<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">「縱使敵陣堅不可摧，勝利之風吹拂之境亦能摧枯拉朽！」</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">大神攻略：當生存比較安全時，建議「戰意」超過三星再使用該技能可以使傷害最大化。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-1505341143",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  },
  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "key": "skill.1431.description",
    "text": "一躍而起對目標及其周圍造成大額<style=\"physical\">物理傷害</style>。每消耗<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>層<style=\"accent-gn\">銳利</style>，該技能獲得<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>充能。<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：銳利衝擊傷害很高，盡可能的消耗銳利，在固定時間內最大化的打出銳利衝擊。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
